{
  "id": "031",
  "title": "Ordering Food",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2016-01-06",
  "synopsis": "Ordering food in China is not always easy. This lesson teaches you how to call for the waiter, specify the spiciness you want, and what to say when the food is taking too long.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/34/0a636830615354512cef02d032842f0093c5c47f.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "点菜\n\n    服务员，菜单，我们还要点菜。给我来个辣子鸡，特辣的；再来个水煮鱼，微辣的；还有5串羊肉串，不要辣；然后来瓶喝的，就燕京啤酒吧，要冰的。另外，之前点的西红柿炒鸡蛋麻烦帮我催一下，太慢了。谢谢！",
    "traditional": "點菜\n\n    服務員，菜單，我們還要點菜。給我來個辣子雞，特辣的；再來個水煮魚，微辣的；還有5串羊肉串，不要辣；然後來瓶喝的，就燕京啤酒吧，要冰的。另外，之前點的西紅柿炒雞蛋麻煩幫我催一下，太慢了。謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ordering food"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "服务员，菜单，我们还要点菜。",
      "traditional": "服務員，菜單，我們還要點菜。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán cài dān wǒ men hái yào diǎn cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "给我来个辣子鸡，特辣的；",
      "traditional": "給我來個辣子雞，特辣的；",
      "pinyin": "gěi wǒ lái ge là zi jī tè là de",
      "english": "Waiter, menu! We want to order."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "再来个水煮鱼，微辣的；",
      "traditional": "再來個水煮魚，微辣的；",
      "pinyin": "zài lái ge shuǐ zhǔ yú wēi là de",
      "english": "Give us one spicy chicken, extra spicy."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "还有5串羊肉串，不要辣；",
      "traditional": "還有5串羊肉串，不要辣；",
      "pinyin": "hái yǒu 1 chuàn yáng ròu chuàn bú yào là",
      "english": "And one boiled fish, mildly spicy."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "然后来瓶喝的，就燕京啤酒吧，要冰的。",
      "traditional": "然後來瓶喝的，就燕京啤酒吧，要冰的。",
      "pinyin": "rán hòu lái píng hē de jiù yān jīng pí jiǔ ba yào bīng de",
      "english": "As well as five lamb skewers, not spicy."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "另外，之前点的西红柿炒鸡蛋麻烦帮我催一下，太慢了。",
      "traditional": "另外，之前點的西紅柿炒雞蛋麻煩幫我催一下，太慢了。",
      "pinyin": "lìng wài zhī qián diǎn de xī hóng shì chǎo jī dàn má fan bāng wǒ cuī yí xià tài màn le",
      "english": "Then give us a bottle of something to drink, a Yanjing Beer will do. Cold."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "谢谢！",
      "traditional": "謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "xiè xie",
      "english": "Additionally, could you hurry up with the stir-fried tomato eggs we ordered before? It's too slow."
    }
  ],
